{"v":1,"book":"Isa","ch":16,"verses":[{"n":1,"text":"Send a lamb of tribute To the ruler of the land, From Sela across the wilderness To the mountain of the daughter of Zion.","tok":[{"t":"Send","s":["H7971"],"a":[0]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"lamb","s":["H3733"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of tribute To the "},{"t":"ruler","s":["H4910"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[3]},{"t":", From "},{"t":"Sela","s":["H5554"],"a":[4]},{"t":" across the "},{"t":"wilderness","s":["H4057"],"a":[5]},{"t":" To the "},{"t":"mountain","s":["H2022"],"a":[7]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"daughter","s":["H1323"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Zion","s":["H6726"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":2,"text":"Like wandering birds, Like a scattered nest, Will the daughters of Moab be At the fords of the Arnon.","tok":[{"t":"Like "},{"t":"wandering","s":["H5074"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"birds","s":["H5775"],"a":[1]},{"t":", Like a scattered "},{"t":"nest","s":["H7064"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Will the "},{"t":"daughters","s":["H1323"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[7]},{"t":" be At the "},{"t":"fords","s":["H4569"],"a":[8]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"Arnon","s":["H0769"],"a":[9]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":3,"text":"Give us counsel, Make a judgment concerning us. Make your shadow at high noon Like night to us. Hide the outcasts; Do not expose him who wanders.","tok":[{"t":"Give us "},{"t":"counsel","s":["H6098"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Make","s":["H7896"],"a":[4]},{"t":" a "},{"t":"judgment","s":["H6415"],"a":[3]},{"t":" concerning us. Make your "},{"t":"shadow","s":["H6738"],"a":[6]},{"t":" at high noon Like "},{"t":"night","s":["H3915"],"a":[5]},{"t":" to us. "},{"t":"Hide","s":["H5641"],"a":[9]},{"t":" the "},{"t":"outcasts","s":["H5080"],"a":[10]},{"t":"; Do not expose him who "},{"t":"wanders","s":["H5074"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":4,"text":"Let the outcasts of Moab Dwell with you; Be a hiding place to them From the destroyer. When the extortioner finishes And destruction ends, When the oppressor is completely gone from the land,","tok":[{"t":"Let the "},{"t":"outcasts","s":["H5080"],"a":[2]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Dwell","s":["H1481"],"a":[0]},{"t":" with "},{"t":"you","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; "},{"t":"Be","s":["H1933"],"a":[4]},{"t":" a hiding place to them From the destroyer. When the "},{"t":"extortioner","s":["H4160"],"a":[11]},{"t":" finishes And destruction "},{"t":"ends","s":["H0656"],"a":[10]},{"t":", When the "},{"t":"oppressor","s":["H7429"],"a":[15]},{"t":" is completely gone from the "},{"t":"land","s":["H0776"],"a":[17]},{"t":","}]},{"n":5,"text":"Then will a throne be established in lovingkindness, And upon it One will sit in truth In the tent of David, Judging and pursuing justice And hastening righteousness.","tok":[{"t":"Then will a "},{"t":"throne","s":["H3678"],"a":[2]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"established","s":["H3559"],"a":[0]},{"t":" in lovingkindness, And upon it One will "},{"t":"sit","s":["H3427"],"a":[3]},{"t":" in "},{"t":"truth","s":["H0571"],"a":[5]},{"t":" In the "},{"t":"tent","s":["H0168"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"David","s":["H1732"],"a":[7]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Judging","s":["H8199"],"a":[8]},{"t":" and pursuing justice And hastening "},{"t":"righteousness","s":["H6664"],"a":[12]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":6,"text":"We have heard of the pride of Moab — He is extremely proud — Of his haughtiness and pride and insolence; His boastings are all untrue.","tok":[{"t":"We have "},{"t":"heard","s":["H8085"],"a":[0]},{"t":" of the "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1347"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[2]},{"t":" — He is extremely "},{"t":"proud","s":["H1341"],"a":[3]},{"t":" — Of his "},{"t":"haughtiness","s":["H1346"],"a":[5]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"pride","s":["H1347"],"a":[6]},{"t":" and insolence; His boastings are all untrue."}]},{"n":7,"text":"Therefore Moab will howl for Moab; They all will howl. For the raisin cakes of Kir-hareseth You will mourn, utterly stricken.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will "},{"t":"howl","s":["H3213"],"a":[1]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":"; They all will "},{"t":"howl","s":["H3213"],"a":[5]},{"t":". For the raisin cakes of "},{"t":"Kir","s":["H7025"],"a":[7]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"hareseth","s":["H7025"],"a":[7]},{"t":" You will "},{"t":"mourn","s":["H1897"],"a":[9]},{"t":", utterly "},{"t":"stricken","s":["H5218"],"a":[11]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":8,"text":"Because the fields of Heshbon have withered, And the vine of Sibmah, too. The lords of the nations Have trampled under its choicest vines, Which reached as far as Jazer, Which meandered into the desert. Its shoots spread abroad; They crossed over to the sea.","tok":[{"t":"Because the "},{"t":"fields","s":["H7709"],"a":[1]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Heshbon","s":["H2809"],"a":[2]},{"t":" have withered, And the "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[4]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Sibmah","s":["H7643"],"a":[5]},{"t":", too. The "},{"t":"lords","s":["H1167"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of the nations Have trampled under its choicest vines, Which reached as far as "},{"t":"Jazer","s":["H3270"],"a":[11]},{"t":", Which meandered into the desert. Its shoots spread abroad; They crossed "},{"t":"over","s":["H5674"],"a":[17]},{"t":" to the "},{"t":"sea","s":["H3220"],"a":[18]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":9,"text":"Therefore I will weep bitterly for Jazer, For the vine of Sibmah; I will soak you with my tears, Heshbon and Elealeh. For the harvest shout is hushed Over your summer fruit and over your reapings.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore I will "},{"t":"weep","s":["H1065"],"a":[3]},{"t":" bitterly for "},{"t":"Jazer","s":["H3270"],"a":[4]},{"t":", For the "},{"t":"vine","s":["H1612"],"a":[5]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Sibmah","s":["H7643"],"a":[6]},{"t":"; I will soak you with my "},{"t":"tears","s":["H1832"],"a":[8]},{"t":", "},{"t":"Heshbon","s":["H2809"],"a":[9]},{"t":" and "},{"t":"Elealeh","s":["H0500"],"a":[10]},{"t":". For the "},{"t":"harvest","s":["H7105"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"shout","s":["H1959"],"a":[16]},{"t":" is hushed Over your summer "},{"t":"fruit","s":["H7019"],"a":[13]},{"t":" and over your reapings."}]},{"n":10,"text":"Rejoicing is taken away, and exultation from the fruited field; In the vineyards there will be no singing for joy; no shouts will be uttered. The treader will not tread out wine in the presses — I have made the harvest shout stop.","tok":[{"t":"Rejoicing is taken "},{"t":"away","s":["H0622"],"a":[0]},{"t":", and exultation from the fruited "},{"t":"field","s":["H3759"],"a":[4]},{"t":"; In the "},{"t":"vineyards","s":["H3754"],"a":[5]},{"t":" there will be no "},{"t":"singing","s":["H7442"],"a":[7]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"joy","s":["H1524"],"a":[2]},{"t":"; no "},{"t":"shouts","s":["H7321"],"a":[9]},{"t":" will be uttered. The "},{"t":"treader","s":["H1869"],"a":[13]},{"t":" will not tread "},{"t":"out","s":["H1869"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"wine","s":["H3196"],"a":[10]},{"t":" in the "},{"t":"presses","s":["H3342"],"a":[11]},{"t":" — I have made the harvest "},{"t":"shout","s":["H1959"],"a":[15]},{"t":" "},{"t":"stop","s":["H7673"],"a":[16]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":11,"text":"Therefore for Moab my bowels will moan like a lyre, And my inward parts for Kir-heres.","tok":[{"t":"Therefore for "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[3]},{"t":" my "},{"t":"bowels","s":["H4578"],"a":[2]},{"t":" will moan like a lyre, And my inward "},{"t":"parts","s":["H7130"],"a":[6]},{"t":" for "},{"t":"Kir","s":["H7025"],"a":[7]},{"t":"-"},{"t":"heres","s":["H7025"],"a":[7]},{"t":"."}]},{"n":12,"text":"And when Moab appears, When they weary themselves at their high place, And come to their sanctuary to pray, It will not avail.","tok":[{"t":"And "},{"t":"when","s":["H7200"],"a":[2]},{"t":" "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[5]},{"t":" appears, When they "},{"t":"weary","s":["H3811"],"a":[4]},{"t":" themselves at their high "},{"t":"place","s":["H1116"],"a":[7]},{"t":", And "},{"t":"come","s":["H0935"],"a":[8]},{"t":" to their "},{"t":"sanctuary","s":["H4720"],"a":[10]},{"t":" to "},{"t":"pray","s":["H6419"],"a":[11]},{"t":", It will not avail."}]},{"n":13,"text":"This is the word which Jehovah spoke concerning Moab long ago.","tok":[{"t":"This is the "},{"t":"word","s":["H1697"],"a":[1]},{"t":" which "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[4]},{"t":" spoke concerning "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[6]},{"t":" long ago."}]},{"n":14,"text":"And now Jehovah has spoken, saying, Within three years, like the years of a hired man, the glory of Moab will be disgraced, with all its great multitude, and its remnant will be small — a mere trifle, nothing great.","tok":[{"t":"And now "},{"t":"Jehovah","s":["H3068"],"a":[2]},{"t":" has "},{"t":"spoken","s":["H1696"],"a":[1]},{"t":", "},{"t":"saying","s":["H0559"],"a":[3]},{"t":", Within "},{"t":"three","s":["H7969"],"a":[4]},{"t":" "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[5]},{"t":", like the "},{"t":"years","s":["H8141"],"a":[6]},{"t":" of a hired man, the "},{"t":"glory","s":["H3519"],"a":[9]},{"t":" of "},{"t":"Moab","s":["H4124"],"a":[10]},{"t":" will be disgraced, with all its "},{"t":"great","s":["H7227"],"a":[13]},{"t":" "},{"t":"multitude","s":["H1995"],"a":[12]},{"t":", and its "},{"t":"remnant","s":["H7605"],"a":[14]},{"t":" "},{"t":"will","s":["H4592"],"a":[15]},{"t":" be "},{"t":"small","s":["H4213"],"a":[16]},{"t":" — a mere trifle, nothing great."}]}]}
